=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Halver (A)} at (L-11), near Veridical Conflux #06.
* He will request two {@i:Lambent Scale|2874} {i:Lambent Scales|Lambent Scale|2874}.
* Lambent Scales drop from {m:Farfadets|Farfadet}, a Thief with a high level of Treasure Hunter is recommended as the drop rate is not superb.
* Trade the Lambent Scales to {p:Halver (A)}.
